title: NPC_Start
---
// Router: ไม่มีบทพูดของตัวเอง — เลือกว่าจะเข้า node ไหนตามความคืบหน้า แล้วใช้ detour เพื่อให้ไหลต่อลงมาข้างล่างได้
// ลำดับ: เรื่องเควส -> เห็ด/ดอกไม้ที่เพิ่งถ่ายมา -> (ถ้ายังไม่มีอะไรให้พูดในรอบนี้) คุยเล่น
<<declare $intro_done = false>>
<<declare $talked = false>>
// ชื่อ NPC ที่ใช้ในบทพูด — ชื่อหน้าบรรทัด "Mia:" ต้องตรงกับ DialogueSpeaker.characterName ของ NPC ด้วย (บับเบิลหาตัวพูดจากชื่อนี้)
<<declare $npc_name = "Mia">>
<<set $talked to false>>

<<if !$intro_done>>
    <<detour Intro>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "NotStarted">>
    <<detour Deer_Offer_Again>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "Active" && has_photo("deer_01")>>
    <<detour Deer_Turnin>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<elseif quest_status("deer_01") == "Active">>
    <<detour Deer_Waiting>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
// เควสมูสปลดหลังส่งเควสกวางเสร็จเท่านั้น (ปกติ Deer_Turnin ให้ต่อทันที กิ่งนี้กันกรณีหลุดไป)
<<elseif quest_status("moose_01") == "NotStarted">>
    <<detour Moose_Offer>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<elseif quest_status("moose_01") == "Active" && has_photo("moose_01")>>
    <<detour Moose_Turnin>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<elseif quest_status("moose_01") == "Active">>
    <<detour Moose_Waiting>>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>

<<detour Discoveries>>

<<if !$talked>>
    <<detour Chat>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Intro
---
Mia: Oh! Footsteps on the trail. My, it's been a long time since I heard those.
Mia: You must be the new trainee they said they were sending. I wasn't sure anyone would actually come.
Player: That's me. I'm here to survey the park - photograph what lives here and bring the records up to date.
Mia: Well then, welcome. My name is {$npc_name}. I've looked after this old park for longer than I care to count.
Mia: You'll find it's quiet work. Not many people come out here anymore. Once the new road went in, folks just sort of... forgot about the place.
Mia: Lonely, some days. But the forest never really empties out. You just have to sit still long enough to notice who's around.
Mia: These old legs don't carry me very far these days, so the survey's been left alone. The records haven't been touched in years.
Player: Then I'll start filling them in.
Mia: Good. It's been a long time since anyone cared about this place but me.
Mia: After all these years, it doesn't feel like a park to me anymore. It feels like home.
Mia: Maybe one day it'll feel a bit like home to you too.
<<set $intro_done to true>>
Mia: Well, no sense standing around. How about we start with an old friend of mine?
<<detour Deer_Offer>>
===

title: Deer_Offer_Again
---
Mia: Oh, you're back. Let me tell you about that deer again.
<<detour Deer_Offer>>
===

title: Deer_Offer
---
Mia: There's a deer that lives around these parts. I'd love to have a nice close-up of it in the records - think you could find it for me?
Mia: Oh, and if anything else catches your eye out there - a mushroom, a pretty flower, whatever - snap a picture and bring it back. We can figure out what it is together.
Mia: I can't get out on the trails much anymore, so it'd be a real treat to see what's out there through your camera.
// คุยแล้วรับเควสเลย ไม่มีตัวเลือกตอบรับ/ปฏิเสธ
<<start_quest "deer_01">>
Mia: Just take it slow, alright? That deer spooks easily.
===

title: Deer_Waiting
---
Mia: Still haven't found the deer? Try checking around the lake, it likes to graze there.
===

title: Deer_Turnin
---
Mia: Oh, you're back! Let's see what you got.
Mia: A nice close-up of the deer - exactly what I was hoping for. Thank you!
<<complete_quest "deer_01">>
<<mark_informed "deer_01">>
Mia: That's the first new entry in the records in years. You did wonderfully.
<<detour Moose_Offer>>
===

title: Moose_Offer
---
// ได้ต่อทันทีหลังส่งเควสกวาง — เช็คซ้ำกันเผลอ detour มาก่อนกวางเสร็จ
<<if quest_status("deer_01") == "Completed">>
    Mia: You've got a good eye, you know that? Let me tell you about another one.
    Mia: I've heard there's a moose wandering around the park. Nobody's managed to get one in the records for ages - if you happen to spot it, I'd love a good photo.
    <<start_quest "moose_01">>
    Mia: Do keep your distance, though. A moose looks calm, but it's a lot bigger than a deer, and a lot grumpier.
<<endif>>
===

title: Moose_Waiting
---
Mia: No luck with the moose yet? They like wet, marshy spots where they can munch on water plants.
===

title: Moose_Turnin
---
Mia: You found the moose? Let me see!
Mia: What a big one - look at the size of those antlers. Great photo!
<<complete_quest "moose_01">>
<<mark_informed "moose_01">>
Mia: Wonderful. That's a record this park hasn't had in a very long time.
===

title: Discoveries
---
// เห็ด/ดอกไม้: ไม่ต้องรับเควส ถ่ายมาเมื่อไหร่ก็ได้ — NPC เล่าให้ฟังครั้งเดียวต่อชนิด (is_informed)
<<if has_photo("Chan") && !is_informed("Chan")>>
    Mia: Ah, a chanterelle too, I see. That golden color gives it away.
    Mia: See the ridges underneath? Those aren't real gills - and it only grows near tree roots like oak or birch.
    <<mark_informed "Chan">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("FlyAgaric") && !is_informed("FlyAgaric")>>
    Mia: And a fly agaric - hard to miss that red cap with the white warts.
    Mia: Pretty to look at, but never eat one raw.
    <<mark_informed "FlyAgaric">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("Honey") && !is_informed("Honey")>>
    Mia: Honey fungus, growing right on that old stump.
    Mia: It's slowly feeding on the wood underneath - its threads can spread for miles underground.
    <<mark_informed "Honey">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("Turkey") && !is_informed("Turkey")>>
    Mia: Turkey tail, with those banded rings of color.
    Mia: It breaks down dead wood bit by bit. Too tough to eat, but good for tea.
    <<mark_informed "Turkey">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("Goldenrod") && !is_informed("Goldenrod")>>
    Mia: Goldenrod! Those little yellow plumes light up the whole meadow this time of year.
    Mia: People blame it for hay fever, but that's usually ragweed. Goldenrod's pollen is too heavy to blow around - the bees carry it instead.
    Mia: It blooms late, after most flowers are gone, so it's one of the last good meals for bees and butterflies before winter.
    <<mark_informed "Goldenrod">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("JoePyeWeed") && !is_informed("JoePyeWeed")>>
    Mia: Ah, Joe-Pye weed. Those dusty pink domes can grow taller than you are.
    Mia: It likes its feet wet, so you'll find it in damp spots and along the stream.
    Mia: The story goes it was named after a healer who used it to treat fevers. Get close and the flowers smell a little like vanilla.
    Mia: Swallowtails and monarchs love it. On a sunny afternoon it's covered in butterflies.
    <<mark_informed "JoePyeWeed">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_photo("puffball") && !is_informed("puffball")>>
    Mia: Oh, a puffball! Careful giving that one a poke once it's fully grown.
    Mia: It'll puff out a cloud of spores if you brush against it. Only good to eat while it's still young and white inside.
    <<mark_informed "puffball">>
    <<set $talked to true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Chat
---
// คุยเล่นตอนผู้เล่นมาคุยซ้ำ — เป็นข้อความ placeholder ให้แก้เป็นเสียงของ NPC
// <<once>> = แต่ละหัวข้อเล่นครั้งเดียว พอหมดทุกหัวข้อจะตกไปที่ <<else>> สุดท้าย
// ตอนมีสัตว์ตัวใหม่ ให้เพิ่ม Offer/Turnin ของตัวนั้นใน NPC_Start และแยก Chat ตามความคืบหน้าที่นี่
<<once>>
    Mia: Funny thing. I've spent most of my life in this park, and it still surprises me.
<<else>>
    <<once>>
        Mia: When I was younger this place was full of families. Picnics, kids yelling down by the water...
        Mia: Now it's mostly me and the birds. Still, I wouldn't want to be anywhere else.
    <<else>>
        Mia: You're doing good work out there. The records haven't looked this full in years.
    <<endonce>>
<<endonce>>
===
